      "created_at": "2015-06-07T12:47:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It would have to be a damaging innate power only to get Living Weapon. Otherwise, it would be ambigious as to who got the card if Argent Adept used one of his innate powers to allow another player to play a card or use a power which then destroyed a target. &nbsp; Similarly with America's Greatest if the player he chose used a damaging power which destroyed a target. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:19:44.321Z",
