      "created_at": "2015-06-08T02:46:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>For an example:</p><p>Sky-Scraper uses her huge base power to destroy a target, earning living weapon.</p><p>Next round she switches to tiny and uses her base power to play a compulsion canister on herself, the damage from compulsion canister would not be increased, because the card played caused the damage, the power only played the card.</p>",
